TradeMaster
An independent derivative of TauricResearch/TradingAgents.
Upstream: https://github.com/TauricResearch/TradingAgents

The upstream Apache License 2.0 and existing copyright notices are retained.
TradeMaster adds a local web workbench, provider integrations, research tools,
forecast experiments, and paper-execution controls. These files have been modified
from the upstream distribution; Git history records the original and local changes.
Third-party notices are retained in docs/third-party/ and relevant source headers.
No third-party model weights or private account datasets are distributed here.
